! Proposed Definitions And Examples


!! Proposed Definition of ''ri'a''

;__ri'a__ (BAI):  With cause... Tags a sumti as fitting the 1st place of rinka.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 1st place of rinka and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is caused by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: rinka, ni'i, mu'i, ki'u

** Keywords: With cause

!! Examples of ''ri'a'' Usage

''.i le bolci cu farlu ri'a le nu mi co'u sarji ri''

!! Proposed Definition of ''ri'a ma   ''

;__ri'a ma__ (BAI*): with what cause? -- sumti question asking for a physical cause; why? --
** Keywords:

!! Examples of ''ri'a ma'' Usage

